---
// 首页第4层「介绍」：左文右图，浅色收尾（画册的文字页），含分部与加入入口
import BranchMap from './BranchMap.astro';
---

<section aria-labelledby="about-title" class="section about-section" id="about">
  <div class="section-inner about-grid">
    <div class="about-copy reveal">
      <p class="section-kicker">About · 小组介绍</p>
      <h2 class="section-title" id="about-title">
        一群追光的<span class="grad-text">摄影爱好者</span>
      </h2>
      <p class="section-lead">
        Seeker追光者是一个摄影爱好小组，相信「拍一张照片，交一个朋友」——
        按下快门的瞬间，我们记录世界，也认识彼此。
      </p>

      <ul class="feature-list">
        <li>
          <span class="feature-dot"></span>
          <span><strong>定期外拍</strong> · 从城市街头到山野湖畔</span>
        </li>
        <li>
          <span class="feature-dot"></span>
          <span><strong>线上活动</strong> · 相隔千里也分享同一束光</span>
        </li>
        <li>
          <span class="feature-dot"></span>
          <span><strong>城市分部</strong> · 越来越多城市亮起追光的灯</span>
        </li>
      </ul>

      <a class="team-link" href="/team">认识主理人团队 →</a>

      <BranchMap />

      <div class="join-row" id="join">
        <a class="join-btn" href="/under-construction">加入我们</a>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div
      class="ph-tile about-photo reveal"
      style="--reveal-delay: 0.1s; background: url('https://r2.xn--seeker-ng2jm403afb4a.club/about/team-photo.png') center / cover no-repeat"
    >
      <span class="photo-label">成员照片墙 · 每一张都是我们</span>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .about-section {
    background: var(--background);
  }

  .about-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1.15fr 1fr;
    gap: 48px;
    align-items: center;
  }

  .section-lead {
    margin-bottom: 24px;
  }

  .feature-list {
    list-style: none;
    margin: 0 0 18px;
    padding: 0;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 10px;
  }

  .team-link {
    display: inline-flex;
    margin-bottom: 22px;
    font-size: 13.5px;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--link);
    text-decoration: none;
  }

  .team-link:hover {
    text-decoration: underline;
    text-underline-offset: 4px;
  }

  .team-link:focus-visible {
    outline: 2px solid var(--link);
    outline-offset: 3px;
    border-radius: 4px;
  }

  .feature-list li {
    display: flex;
    align-items: baseline;
    gap: 10px;
    font-size: 14.5px;
    color: var(--muted-foreground);
  }

  .feature-list strong {
    color: var(--foreground);
    font-weight: 600;
  }

  .feature-dot {
    width: 7px;
    height: 7px;
    flex-shrink: 0;
    border-radius: 999px;
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--grad-a), var(--grad-b));
    transform: translateY(-1px);
  }

  .join-row {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 14px;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
  }

  .join-btn {
    display: inline-flex;
    padding: 11px 30px;
    border-radius: 999px;
    background: linear-gradient(45deg, var(--grad-a), var(--grad-b));
    color: var(--on-gradient);
    font-size: 14.5px;
    font-weight: 700;
    text-decoration: none;
    letter-spacing: 0.04em;
    transition:
      transform 0.25s ease,
      box-shadow 0.25s ease;
  }

  .join-btn:hover {
    transform: translateY(-2px);
    box-shadow: var(--glass-hover-shadow);
  }

  .join-btn:focus-visible {
    outline: 2px solid var(--link);
    outline-offset: 3px;
  }

  .about-photo {
    display: flex;
    align-items: flex-end;
    padding: 18px;
    aspect-ratio: 4 / 4.6;
    max-height: 560px;
    width: 100%;
    border-radius: 18px;
  }

  .photo-label {
    font-family: 'Archivo', sans-serif;
    font-size: 11px;
    letter-spacing: 0.14em;
    color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.55);
  }

  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .about-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: 28px;
    }

    .about-photo {
      aspect-ratio: 16 / 9;
      max-height: none;
    }
  }
</style>
